19
00:01:25,967 --> 00:01:30,942
then run it for ten simulated minutes. The
observation is a J2 stop at 95

20
00:01:30,967 --> 00:01:35,867
degrees. The cause list narrows to H1. The
ledger pairs each forecast with

21
00:01:35,892 --> 00:01:40,124
its observation, so I can check what
changed. A test is useful when possible

22
00:01:40,174 --> 00:01:44,649
causes predict different outcomes. P1
spent five minutes without separating

23
00:01:44,699 --> 00:01:49,849
