38
00:03:05,044 --> 00:03:09,444
Behind the screen, deterministic rules
keep the exercise fair. The browser

39
00:03:09,494 --> 00:03:13,469
sends a forecast or test choice to the
service. The service enforces the run

40
00:03:13,519 --> 00:03:17,794
