optional Examiner feedback acts like a

48
00:03:46,647 --> 00:03:50,878
coach: it explains your evidence claims
but never changes your score. This

49
00:03:50,928 --> 00:03:55,328
keeps the learner's reasoning—not AI
guesswork—at the center. The local

50
00:03:55,378 --> 00:03:59,428
