how new evidence changed your

52
00:04:03,028 --> 00:04:07,753
diagnosis. The experience is a simulator;
it is not connected to real

53
00:04:07,803 --> 00:04:08,284
equipment.

54
00:04:10,044 --> 00:04:13,744
Why does the budget matter? It trains you
to trade time for information:

55
00:04:13,819 --> 00:04:16,819
choose tests that separate causes and
avoid spending minutes on

56
00:04:16,869 --> 00:04:21,569
uninformative probes. In this local build,
case validation, sixty-four unit

57
00:04:21,619 --> 00:04:25,764
