Accessibility checks include

58
00:04:25,814 --> 00:04:30,064
keyboard and responsive use. That gives
confidence in the simulator, not

59
00:04:30,139 --> 00:04:30,891
real equipment.

60
00:04:40,065 --> 00:04:43,490
TwinSleuth is a local troubleshooting
practice website for maintenance

61
00:04:43,540 --> 00:04:48,140
learners. It teaches you to predict first,
spend tests deliberately, compare

62
00:04:48,190 --> 00:04:52,365
